# Proof of Valor (WotG 21), the whole run, in Southern San d'Oria [S]. The first Raustigne trigger answers message
# 14025 [20] and 14026 (the petition count) and sets mustZone; the second reaches the zone's default event 606. Each
# of the ten petition NPCs (Illeuse 115 to Mailleronce 122, Remiotte 124, Aissaville 123) plays its event; the
# finish sets its Status bit, adds 1 to Option and answers message 14297 [1162, total]. A second Illeuse trigger
# reaches a default event. Eumielle 131 sets Remind; the next trigger plays 141; the cassoulet trade plays 135 and
# adds 12. After a zone round trip Raustigne plays 148 and the finish with option 1 gives the reward and completes
# the mission (state: A Sanguinary Prelude current).
